DESCRIPTION:Our 8-week Mindfulness based Addiction Recovery programme has 
 helped hundreds of people free themselves of unhealthy habits. Whether thi
 s is a cycle of workaholism\, sugar cravings\, or you need a digital break
  but can’t stop checking your phone\; Mindful Recovery will help free yo
 u from unhelpful patterns of behaviour.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mindful-recovery-mar-202
 6
