BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Film Night:
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260411T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260411T213000
UID:0175c443d4ef007e5962cf00@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Sound of Metal follows a drummer whose sudden hearing loss for
 ces him into a profound confrontation with impermanence\, identity\, and a
 cceptance. It’s a moving\, quietly powerful film about the challenge of 
 finding peace in the face of loss. Contains frequent use of strong languag
 e.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/film-night-2026-04-11
END:VEVENT
