SUMMARY:Buddhism & 12-Step Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260412T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260412T170000
UID:971c25f5a325435079b17494@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:The 12-step programme provides a set of twelve clear steps tow
 ards addiction recovery. Join us for a day exploring 12-Step Recovery in t
 he context of Buddhist practice. Through meditation\, talks\, reflection a
 nd ritual\, we’ll be sharing our experience\, strength and vision.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/buddhism-12-step-day-202
 6-04-12
